@BudgetApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Ingest all four South African indicators
POST {{BudgetApi_HostAddress}}/api/ingestion/run

### Ingest one indicator (cpi_headline, cpi_core, electricity_price, fuel_price)
POST {{BudgetApi_HostAddress}}/api/ingestion/fuel_price

### Indicator catalog
GET {{BudgetApi_HostAddress}}/api/indicators/catalog

###
GET {{BudgetApi_HostAddress}}/api/indicators?code=electricity_price&take=10

###
GET {{BudgetApi_HostAddress}}/api/indicators/alerts?take=20
